    "title": "Kylie Jenner's Escapes Wardrobe Mishap as She Fixes Hair in Video - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Evolve Editors ,\n1 hours ago Photo Credit: Kylie Jenner Instagram Kylie Jenner is keeping her fans on a chokehold with her new video in a cami top. The beauty mogul has shared an exciting post on her social media. It showed her fixing her hair gracefully, which affects her outfit.\nKylie Jenner’s video shows her fixing her hair in a risky cami top Take a look at the latest video of Jenner fixing her hair in a risky cami top.\nThe businesswoman recently took to her Instagram stories to share an adorable video. She captioned the short clip, “Got a little haircut today” with feeling loved emojis. It witnessed Keeping Up with the Kardashians star on a car ride wearing a white cami top, which slips a bit while flaunting her new haircut.\nJenner seems to have gone for a layered haircut with her locks getting a bouncy feel. She fixes her hair gracefully, proving she wants her look to be perfect. Moreover, Jenner opts for bright makeup with light pink blush and shiny lip gloss.\nOriginally reported by Ritika Singh on Reality Tea\nThe post Kylie Jenner’s Escapes Wardrobe Mishap as She Fixes Hair in Video appeared first on Mandatory .",
